The current simulation uses browser speech synthesis, not a real telephone connection.

The architecture may retain a provider-independent telephony adapter for future integration.

However, the current application must not claim to be receiving real telephone calls.

Africa's Talking and Termii were previously considered in the architecture but have been removed from the active integration plan.

Do not reintroduce them as live integrations without a separate decision.

## 15.2 Location and routing

Leaflet and OpenStreetMap are retained for mapping.

OpenRouteService is retained where its integration is working.

Do not fabricate route data or travel-time estimates when routing is unavailable.

## 15.3 Authentication and persistence

Firebase Authentication and Firestore are retained.

Preserve existing authentication and data functionality.

Incident state, unit state and audit history should be consistent across the application.

Do not build disconnected mock data into individual pages if the existing application already has a shared state or persistence layer.

